    "created_at": "2016-06-07T14:57:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-07T14:57:56Z",
    "body": "No, note that we operate on a copy of the object's listeners there. We have that copy to prevent new listeners from being added, but we use removed to still allow removal of them (either through this once feature or the `removeEventListener()` method).\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
