    "updated_at": "2016-06-07T15:50:31Z",
    "body": "@annevk I see now that the 'removed' flag is indeed useful when calling removeEventListener(). \nHowever, I do not understand yet why setting the 'removed' flag to true is still useful for 'once' event listeners if we move step 8 between 4 and 5. It seems to me that if we move step 8 between 4 and 5, we could drop the \"then set listener’s removed to true\" part of step 8.\n",
